## Q: How much overdue receivable is stuck in high-risk accounts by agent?
status=COMPLETED  (13.9s)
Genie: You want to see the total amount of overdue receivables and the number of high-risk accounts for each agent, focusing only on accounts classified as high risk.
SQL:
SELECT
  `agent_name`,
  COUNT(*) AS `high_risk_accounts`,
  ROUND(SUM(`overdue_ar`)) AS `overdue_ar`
FROM `serverless_stable_0dcqtv_catalog`.`smb_cashflow`.`account_cashflow_health`
